# ─── Rust build artifacts ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
/target
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# Cargo lockfile: normally COMMITTED for a binary. This workshop depends on an
# unpublished SDK by local path, so the lock would pin a machine-specific SDK
# version. Revisit (and commit it) once the SDK ships to crates.io.
Cargo.lock

# ─── Secrets & credentials - never push these ───────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
credentials
.aws/
secrets.*

# ─── Build / packaging output ───────────────────────────────────────────────
/dist
/out

# ─── Chapter 5 knowledge base ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# The Basic Rules PDF is licensed for personal use only, so each reader fetches
# their own copy; the embeddings built from it are regenerated locally, into
# ExtendDB's database (`extenddb serve --foreground`, run from the repo root).
/5_a2a_integration/utils/*.pdf
/extenddb.sqlite*

# ─── OS cruft ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ─── Editor / IDE ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
.kiro/
*.swp
*~
